# Implementation Plan - Add Swagger Documentation to AccessController

The goal is to add OpenAPI (Swagger) annotations to [AccessController.java](file:///e:/WEB/PROJECTS/JAVA/boshqa%20loyihalar/MedPulse/soccial-network-main/CODEUZ/api.medpulse.uz/src/main/java/api/medpulse/uz/controller/AccessController.java) to improve API documentation, specifically for [generateCode()](file:///e:/WEB/PROJECTS/JAVA/boshqa%20loyihalar/MedPulse/soccial-network-main/CODEUZ/api.medpulse.uz/src/main/java/api/medpulse/uz/controller/AccessController.java#15-20) and [verifyCode()](file:///e:/WEB/PROJECTS/JAVA/boshqa%20loyihalar/MedPulse/soccial-network-main/CODEUZ/api.medpulse.uz/src/main/java/api/medpulse/uz/controller/AccessController.java#21-27) methods.

## Proposed Changes

### [AccessController](file:///e:/WEB/PROJECTS/JAVA/boshqa%20loyihalar/MedPulse/soccial-network-main/CODEUZ/api.medpulse.uz/src/main/java/api/medpulse/uz/controller/AccessController.java)

- Add `@Tag` annotation to the class level to categorize the API.
- Add `@Operation` annotations to [generateCode](file:///e:/WEB/PROJECTS/JAVA/boshqa%20loyihalar/MedPulse/soccial-network-main/CODEUZ/api.medpulse.uz/src/main/java/api/medpulse/uz/controller/AccessController.java#15-20) and [verifyCode](file:///e:/WEB/PROJECTS/JAVA/boshqa%20loyihalar/MedPulse/soccial-network-main/CODEUZ/api.medpulse.uz/src/main/java/api/medpulse/uz/controller/AccessController.java#21-27) methods.
- Add `@Parameter` annotations to describe method parameters.

#### [MODIFY] [AccessController.java](file:///e:/WEB/PROJECTS/JAVA/boshqa%20loyihalar/MedPulse/soccial-network-main/CODEUZ/api.medpulse.uz/src/main/java/api/medpulse/uz/controller/AccessController.java)

```java
@Tag(name = "Access Controller", description = "API for generating and verifying access codes for patients")
public class AccessController {
    // ...
    @Operation(summary = "Generate access code", description = "Generates a temporary access code for a patient. Requires USER role.")
    public ResponseEntity<String> generateCode(@Parameter(description = "ID of the patient") @PathVariable String patientId) { ... }

    @Operation(summary = "Verify access code", description = "Verifies the access code provided by a doctor. Requires DOCTOR role. Returns Patient ID.")
    public ResponseEntity<String> verifyCode(@Parameter(description = "Access code to verify") @RequestParam("code") String code) { ... }
}
```

